feae28027e4354.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772096338","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374640/1c230815a1a0b39e437c33cc27feae28027e4354/ss_1c230815a1a0b39e437c33cc27feae28027e4354.600x338.jpg?t=1772096338"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374640/8d85903811492fcc4d52dba7d26f3706838e4fa4/ss_8d85903811492fcc4d52dba7d26f3706838e4fa4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772096338","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374640/8d85903811492fcc4d52dba7d26f3706838e4fa4/ss_8d85903811492fcc4d52dba7d26f3706838e4fa4.600x338.jpg?t=1772096338"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374640/dd71000964aa7796299c202f2b430098451ad0a5/ss_dd71000964aa7796299c202f2b430098451ad0a5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772096338","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374640/dd71000964aa7796299c202f2b430098451ad0a5/ss_dd71000964aa7796299c202f2b430098451ad0a5.600x338.jpg?t=1772096338"}],"short_description":"In Crown of Hispania, every lord, king and queen must fight to retain his or her power. Will you become a legendary ruler, or will you be rejected by those forgotten by history? Crown of Hispania is a strategy game that plunges players into the turmoil of medieval Iberia.","steam_appid":3374640,"support_info":{"email":"studioregalis@gmail.com","url":"https://www.regalisstudios.com/contact"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Spanish - Spain","type":"game","website":"https://www.regalisstudios.com/crown-of-hispania"}